    45	                    "room " + room.number() + " takes at most " + room.capacity() + " guests");
    46	        }
    47	        boolean roomTaken = store.all().stream()
    48	                .filter(existing -> existing.status() != ReservationStatus.CANCELLED)
    49	                .anyMatch(existing -> existing.overlaps(room.number(), request.checkIn(), request.checkOut()));
    50	        if (roomTaken) {
    51	            throw new HotelException(
    52	                    ErrorCode.ROOM_UNAVAILABLE, "room " + room.number() + " is taken on some of those nights");
    53	        }
